# Optional local editor state
*.tmp
*.log

# Agent collaboration worktrees (local IDE/runtime sandboxes only). Projections under .claude/, .grok/ etc. are adapters only; the source of truth is agent_collab/registry/.
.claude/worktrees/
.grok/worktrees/
.cursor/worktrees/

# Environment secrets — API keys, DB URL, GH_TOKEN/GITHUB_TOKEN. NEVER commit.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local agent settings — may hold secrets (e.g. GH_TOKEN/GITHUB_TOKEN). NEVER commit.
.claude/settings.local.json
.grok/settings.local.json

# Agent collaboration volatile runtime state only (core protocol + scripts + context + registry + durable handoffs/outbox/state are committed and shared)
agent_collab/state/orchestrator.lock
agent_collab/logs/orchestrator.log

# Note: AGENTS.md and docs/CollaborationSystem-Phase2-Design.md are now tracked as they document the system.
# All agent_collab/ except the volatile paths above must be committed for the collab protocol to be usable after clone.
# (See agent_collab/ source of truth, test in Test-AgentCollabScaffold.ps1)

# Do NOT ignore these:
# Config/
# Content/
# Plugins/
# Source/
# *.uproject

# GloamsteadForge emitted runtime evidence (regenerated by the evidence emitter test; not source)
procedural/reports/

# Imported third-party / vendored content — large binary Megascans foliage (~24 GB), re-importable from Fab.
# Kept local only; NOT committed to plain-git history (decided 2026-07-20). Re-acquire from the source packs.
Content/BlackAlder/
Content/CommonHazel/
Content/EuropeanHornbeam/
Content/MSPresets/

# Third-party / local-tooling plugins — kept local only (decided 2026-07-20).
# NeoStackAI = local agent bridge (Fab marketplace); CoreTerrainMaterials = marketplace terrain plugin.
# WorldForge (project-authored) is committed; its Binaries/Intermediate are covered by the global rules above.
Plugins/NeoStackAI/
Plugins/CoreTerrainMaterials/
